Package: bmmtools
Title: Validate Cognitive Measurement Models Fitted with 'bmm'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Gidon T.", "Frischkorn", , "gidon.frischkorn@psychologie.uzh.ch", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5055-9764"))
Description: Parameter recovery, prior predictive checks on the observable
    scale, simulation-based calibration and reference cross-checks for
    cognitive measurement models fitted with the 'bmm' package. The
    validation half of the 'bmm' model-development workflow:
    bmm::use_model_template() scaffolds a model, 'bmmtools' checks that it
    can be estimated, that its priors are sane, that its implementation is
    correct and that it agrees with what is already known.
